  "solution": "Sắp xếp dãy số liệu thành một dãy không giảm\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>24</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>37</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>38</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>38</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>43</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>47</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>48</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>48</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mn>70</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khoảng tứ phân vị <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>△</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>△</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đoạn chứa các giá trị hợp lệ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>70</mn></semantics></math> là giá trị bất thường của mẫu số liệu.",
